# The Backup parity table: origin/main's Backup screen against Backup's control on the engine
# (refactor plan §2, slice 3's unit (b2), next/s3-parity; docs/engine/parity-backup.md).
# Generated by TestParity (pkg/screens/backup); make golden-update rewrites it. Do not edit.
# origin/main: pkg/characterization's goldens (menu/backup_*), read in place; their $TMP is
# the root, so $TMP/var/backups/hardn is /var/backups/hardn, and $TMP/home, the run's HOME,
# is $HOME. "(screen)": the screen's own write test on a draw, with os, read from its line
# "Backup directory exists and is writable". hardn.yml's mode: origin/main's is not recorded,
# so not compared. The new path: Backup's control
# through screenkit.Session.Change and the engine, as unit (c)'s screen is to run it, and its
# Check, on hostfake: written, not run (gate 5).
# Sources: V<n> side-effects.md §8, named by the cell's golden; decision <n> gallery-backup.md §5
# (adopted 2026-10-27); control-backup.md by section (§6-7's words adopted 2026-10-27);
# plan §3.16, §3.19 (as amended 2026-10-22); side-effects row <n> (§3).

